Modified by CiukiOS, 2026-10-20. LGPL-2.1-or-later.
Remove the three Wine-private calls of SHELL32: there is no Unix file
namespace (wine_get_dos_file_name, wine_get_unix_file_name report no
mapping) and no host operating system (wine_get_host_version; the XDG
trash path is never macOS). The recycle bin needs WINEHOMEDIR, never set.

